BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Implementing and Configuring User Impersonation - Brandon Biggs [I
 daho National Lab]
DTSTART;TZID=US/Mountain:20260311T113000
DTEND;TZID=US/Mountain:20260311T115500
DTSTAMP:20261020T211125Z
UID:pretalx-good-2026-CCJPZN@pretalx.com
DESCRIPTION:User impersonation is a powerful capability within Open OnDema
 nd that enables designated users—such as administrators\, support staff
 \, or service accounts—to act on behalf of other users to troubleshoot i
 ssues\, validate configurations\, and streamline workflows. As HPC centers
  grow more complex and support demands increase\, a flexible and secure im
 personation model becomes essential.
